    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "d1",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "- Clients: Telegram Bot (aiogram) & Next.js Frontend UI\n- Proxy / Gateway: Nginx (80/443), Next.js Edge proxy\n- Backend: FastAPI (server.py) with signed X-User-* headers\n- Databases: PostgreSQL (RDS) + Qdrant Vector Search (6333)",
      "originalText": "- Clients: Telegram Bot (aiogram) & Next.js Frontend UI\n- Proxy / Gateway: Nginx (80/443), Next.js Edge proxy\n- Backend: FastAPI (server.py) with signed X-User-* headers\n- Databases: PostgreSQL (RDS) + Qdrant Vector Search (6333)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
