    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "d2",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "- User Prompt -> /chat endpoint -> Resolve Identity & Session\n- Pydantic-AI Agent Engine loads system prompt from turath-index-skill.md\n- Iterates through model requests & tool calls (Quran, Hadith, Tafsir, Search)\n- Yields SSE events (message_start, text_delta, tool, done)\n- Persists conversation state to sessions.pydantic_message in Postgres",
      "originalText": "- User Prompt -> /chat endpoint -> Resolve Identity & Session\n- Pydantic-AI Agent Engine loads system prompt from turath-index-skill.md\n- Iterates through model requests & tool calls (Quran, Hadith, Tafsir, Search)\n- Yields SSE events (message_start, text_delta, tool, done)\n- Persists conversation state to sessions.pydantic_message in Postgres",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
