    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "d3",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "- Query Text -> Preprocessing (CamelTools dediac + normalize alef)\n- Dense Embeddings: GATE-AraBert-v1\n- Sparse Embeddings: Fastembed BM25\n- Qdrant Fusion Query (RRF: Reciprocal Rank Fusion)\n- Cross-Encoder Reranking: mmarco-mMiniLMv2-L12",
      "originalText": "- Query Text -> Preprocessing (CamelTools dediac + normalize alef)\n- Dense Embeddings: GATE-AraBert-v1\n- Sparse Embeddings: Fastembed BM25\n- Qdrant Fusion Query (RRF: Reciprocal Rank Fusion)\n- Cross-Encoder Reranking: mmarco-mMiniLMv2-L12",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
