    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "d4",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "- Core Tables: users, sessions, messages, providers, user_providers, provider_models, surahs, ayahs, hadiths, themes\n- Note: `sessions` (agent conversation) is distinct from Better Auth `session`\n- Deployment: Docker Compose (backend, telegram bot, nginx, omniroute) + external Postgres & Qdrant",
